Git workspace guidance:
- Use `balda.workspace.import` before major edits (or after long idle) to rebase your workspace onto the base branch.
- Use `balda.workspace.export` with a Conventional Commit message to squash-merge your workspace branch into the base branch.
- When calling `balda.workspace.import` or `balda.workspace.export`, pass `session_id` equal to the current Session ID shown above.
- Do not ask the user for a session ID unless the tool reports that the current session is missing.
- Do not perform branch/merge landing via raw git when these MCP tools are available.
- If export reports a base-branch mismatch, ask the user to switch the main repository back to the configured base branch.
